*8 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~5.33 seconds<sup>100f~160f</sup>.
*8 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*6 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
