*8 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] make this stage incredibly easy (tested with level 30 roe and level 50 courier). You have a lot of slots left because of this. Utilize catcombos or units like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to deal with the Shy Boys. The incessant peon spam can be defeated with counter-spam.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Ancient Egg: N206 (Special Cat)|Clam Cat]]: Clam Cat has 3 perks that make it useful here, Red Resistance, Knockback Immunity and low range. These three things combine to make it a wonderful meatshield for this stage, though it does have rather slow movement speed and a long recharge time.
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]: Courier is an obvious choice for this stage. Its Long Distance allows it to hit the J.J. Jackrabbits and Trolly Bloggers before they even become a problem, and it can shred the Shy Boys with its Massive Damage vs Red.
*[[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]]: Performs similarly to Clam Cat, however they trade Knockback Immunity for quick speed and much higher health. With Courier, Roe is definitely the better choice between the two.

